{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n限定3日!食盡稀少雞部位+手握壽司\n</p>\n<h2>火赤x鮨割烹朱雀四手聯乘晚宴！</h2>\n<p>尖沙咀人氣日式串燒專門店火赤 迎來開業四週年，特別攜手即將於 11 月隆重開幕的日式餐飲品牌 鮨割烹朱雀，於10 月 27 日至 29 日一連三晚推出四手聯乘盛宴。兩位主廚跳脫傳統框架，展現兩派工藝的無縫交融。</p>\n<h2>帶來多款突破常規創作料理！</h2>\n<p>兩位主廚帶來突破常規的創作「鮟鱇魚肝釀阿波尾雞手羽」外脆內腴，將雞翼與鱇魚肝的脂香完美交融，口感獨特；「烤香魚酥餅」則揉合千層酥皮與特調「蓼酢」。板前握壽司有肉質爽脆緊實的 「深海池魚」、以豐腴魚油香氣的「炭炙金目鯛」、鮮甜濃醇的「鹽水海膽」、脂香四溢的「本鮪拖羅」等。 同樣亦供應火赤備受讚譽的王牌串燒，包括招牌糯米雞、名物「提燈」，以及鹽燒雞腿肉、雞頸肉與稀少部位雞食道，將炙烤香氣推向極致。</p>\n<p>火赤 Akai Honoo<br/>\n地址：九龍尖沙咀金巴利道 40 號 MW Plaza 3 樓 �電話：<a>2885 1688</a> / 6623 1688<br/>\n價錢： $1280/位（另設加一服務費）<br/>\n供應時間：2026 年 10 月 27 日至 10 月 29 日(星期二至星期四，限定三晚) 晚市時段 18:00-00:00<br>\n官方IG：@akaihonoo_hk</br></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267045853578715_13084762516ad9fafb8b3b6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267045853578715_13084762516ad9fafb8b3b6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17926704620848126_11658278306ad9fafe84653.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17926704620848126_11658278306ad9fafe84653.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267046521211048_4032177556ad9fb01a641c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267046521211048_4032177556ad9fb01a641c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267046831699755_798227326ad9fb04db4ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267046831699755_798227326ad9fb04db4ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267047162912598_18794201236ad9fb082d988.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267047162912598_18794201236ad9fb082d988.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267047505378038_9286641476ad9fb0ba06eb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267047505378038_9286641476ad9fb0ba06eb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267047851645745_4373559626ad9fb0ee98c9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179267047851645745_4373559626ad9fb0ee98c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Deyt9lYD6kj/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:02.165586+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":671,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:01:20+00:00","fetche